{"speciesId":322,"names":{"fr":"Chamallot","es":"Numel","en":"Numel","ja":"ドンメル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"NUMEL is extremely dull witted - it doesn’t notice being hit. However, it can’t stand hunger for even a second. This POKéMON’s body is a seething cauldron of boiling magma."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"NUMEL stores magma of almost 2,200 degrees F within its body. If it gets wet, the magma cools and hardens. In that event, the POKéMON’s body grows heavy and its movements become sluggish."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A NUMEL stores boiling magma in the hump on its back. It is a hardy POKéMON that can transport a 220-pound load. It has served humans at work since long ago."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Magma of almost 2,200 degrees Fahrenheit courses through its body. When it grows cold, the magma hardens and slows it."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Magma of almost 2,200 degrees Fahrenheit courses through its body. When it grows cold, the magma hardens and slows it."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its humped back stores intensely hot magma. In rain, the magma cools, slowing its movement."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its humped back stores intensely hot magma. In rain, the magma cools, slowing its movement."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its humped back stores intensely hot magma. In rain, the magma cools, slowing its movement."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"The flaming magma it stores in the hump on its back is the source of its tremendous power."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"The flaming magma it stores in the hump on its back is the source of its tremendous power."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Son dos bossu renferme une lave bouillonnante. Elle refroidit par temps de pluie, ce qui le ralentit."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its humped back stores intensely hot magma. In rain, the magma cools, slowing its movement."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Son dos bossu renferme une lave bouillonnante. Elle refroidit par temps de pluie, ce qui le ralentit."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its humped back stores intensely hot magma. In rain, the magma cools, slowing its movement."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The magma in its body reaches 2,200 degrees F. Its hump gets smaller when it uses Fire-type moves."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The magma in its body reaches 2,200 degrees F. Its hump gets smaller when it uses Fire-type moves."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Son dos bossu renferme une lave bouillonnante. Elle refroidit par temps de pluie, ce qui le ralentit."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"En su joroba almacena magma ardiente que se enfría cuando llueve y lo ralentiza."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its humped back stores intensely hot magma. In rain, the magma cools, slowing its movement."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"灼熱の マグマを 背中の コブに ためている。雨に 当たると マグマが 冷えて 動きが 鈍る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Son corps renferme une lave à plus de 1 200 °C. Sa bosse se contracte lorsqu’il utilise des capacités de type Feu."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Almacena en su cuerpo magma a 1200 °C. Su joroba mengua cuando utiliza movimientos de tipo Fuego."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The magma in its body reaches 2,200 degrees Fahrenheit. Its hump gets smaller when it uses Fire-type moves."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"１２００度の マグマを 体内に ためこんでいる。炎の 技を 使うと コブは 小さく しぼむ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Chamallot est terriblement lent d’esprit. Il ne remarque même pas quand il est touché. Il ne supporte pas d’avoir faim, même une seconde. Le corps de ce Pokémon est comparable à un chaudron de magma bouillonnant."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Numel tarda en percibir las cosas, no se entera ni cuando lo golpean, pero se da cuenta enseguida de si tiene hambre. El cuerpo de este Pokémon es un caldero de magma hirviendo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Numel is extremely dull witted—it doesn’t notice being hit. However, it can’t stand hunger for even a second. This Pokémon’s body is a seething cauldron of boiling magma."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"たたかれても 気が つかない 鈍さ だが 空腹は １秒でも 我慢 できない。 体の 中では マグマが 煮えたぎっている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Chamallot stocke du magma à 1 200 °C dans son corps. Lorsqu’il est mouillé, le magma se refroidit et durcit. Le corps du Pokémon devient alors très lourd et ses mouvements très lents."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Numel acumula en su interior un magma de 1200 °C. Si se moja, el magma se enfría y se solidifica. Cuando esto ocurre, aumenta su tamaño y se vuelve pesado y lento en sus movimientos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Numel stores magma of almost 2,200 degrees Fahrenheit within its body. If it gets wet, the magma cools and hardens. In that event, the Pokémon’s body grows heavy and its movements become sluggish."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"１２００度の マグマを 体に ためている。 水に ぬれると マグマが 冷えて 固まり 重たくなるので 動きが 鈍って しまう。"}],"varieties":[{"id":322,"moves":[{"name":"stomp","learns":[[5,"egg",0],[6,"egg",0],[7,"egg",0],[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[5,"egg",0],[6,"egg",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,